               <note type="editorial">
                  <p>DNB</p>
                  <p>Between 1807 and 1828 there are no references to Charles Heath’s father <persName key="HEA02">James Heath</persName>, instead there are more frequent references to James’ sons Charles and <persName key="HEA04">George</persName>. The lack of contact with James during this period was potentially due to a falling out over financial matters to do with William Nicholson. </p>
               </note>
